    <string name="google_takeout_description">
        To export your notes from Google Keep:\n\n
        1. Visit Google Takeout: https://takeout.google.com\n
        2. Select only “Keep”\n
        3. Click “Next step” and configure export options\n
        4. Click “Create export”\n
        5. Download the .zip file when ready\n
        6. Import the .zip directly — no need to extract it\n\n
        Note: only text is imported. Images, audio and drawings are not supported.
    </string>

